&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="あらすじ"&gt;あらすじ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Main character was used to be a normal taxi driver until he opens Pandora&amp;rsquo;s Box. After opening said box, he gets infatuated to the point that his main objective is to violate 5 female passengers with different jobs, ranging from High School Student, Miko, Violinist, Office Lady to Waitress not only in the taxi but also your house or even public places like the park or places they belong to.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>